<Layout
	title="Soul Garden"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
	    Magic had always been a hidden yet inseparable part of this world. But six years after the Rapture, a supernatural catastrophe that devastated a vast portion of the globe, the extraordinary has become the new ordinary. Encountering an ability user on the street is no different from passing a salaryman, and the criminals lurking in the shadows are more powerful than ever.
	</p>

	<p>
	    To combat this new threat to the recovering world, Shirogane establishes an organisation dedicated to hunting them down and eliminating those deemed too dangerous to roam the city's streets. Be they bosses of the criminal underground, ruthless serial killers, or unfortunate souls unable to control their own abilities, it is Shirogane HQ's duty to remove them from the chessboard.
	</p>

	<p>
	    Guiding such life-and-death decisions is Shirogane's ability known as Soul Garden. It allows him to peer into the inner gardens where people's souls dwell, laying bare the very traits that define them.
	</p>

	<p>
	    Among the cases that come to his attention is that of a rumoured vampire girl said to have killed dozens, with not a single witness left alive to tell the tale.
	</p>

	<p>
	    But she is not the only matter demanding the organisation's focus. The sudden reappearance of Mashiro Takuya, 21st century's most dangerous criminal, threatens to throw Shirogane HQ into turmoil—a shadow woven deeper into its core than anyone suspects.
	</p>
</Layout>